{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:712","content":{"id":712,"title":"最小路径和","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a381ac95-34a3-43de-ae17-613cc1f5045f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fbf048ca-9cd4-4898-bfa6-6607791d00c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给定一个包含非负整数的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"m \\times n","collabId":"ace555fa-8415-4b7e-a638-780f3c0ce069","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"m \\times n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 网格 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"grid"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，请找出一条从左上角到右下角的路径，使得路径上的数字总和为最小。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7862407e-9230-4fd9-8660-be29907d3fe8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说明：每次只能向下或者向右移动一步。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0cccce09-8e9d-4e0c-9b9b-ba98c2ceaf7f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"07340e75-adb4-4e2d-abef-ea506ac40195","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"259a50dd-0378-4da8-9ede-2f5b47b10547","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：grid = [[1,3,1],[1,5,1],[4,2,1]]\n输出：7","collabId":"4d793864-caf8-4883-96b6-97495d6285f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dee38da1-3277-4128-b72c-8e04518c9e27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"e7ba3982-7000-4709-8e58-50c2ff965a6e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"dcd81e99-5fd0-43b0-b2ad-58eee1dd03fd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：grid = [[1,2,3],[4,5,6]]\n输出：12","collabId":"46a99d4f-c58c-40ae-a956-25029b91fd98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"ee44581b-5f86-4681-bf5e-8f1789122088","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d43d940c-6c33-4a7d-b980-35d7ae04d25c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们创建一个二维数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i][j]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示从起点到达坐标 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(i, j)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的最短路径，那么我们可以得到更新公式"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\text{dp}[i][j] = \\min\\{ \\text{dp}[i-1][j] + \\text{dp}[i][j - 1] \\} + \\text{grid}[i][j]","collabId":"7604690d-d58b-4acb-a87d-e58b8f31c83a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"ea3fb1ed-d97a-46ab-bc72-b2b8432f0fbd","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3d73c713-eecc-49d0-b3c7-578698734f4e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int minPathSum(int[][] grid) {\n    int m = grid.length;\n    int n = grid[0].length;\n\n    int[][] dp = new int[m][n];\n    dp[0][0] = grid[0][0];\n    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        dp[0][i] = grid[0][i] + dp[0][ i - 1];\n    }\n    for (int i = 1; i < m; i++) {\n        dp[i][0] = grid[i][0] + dp[i - 1][0];\n    }\n\n    for (int i = 1; i < m; i++) {\n        for (int j = 1; j < n; j++) {\n            dp[i][j] = grid[i][j] + Math.min(dp[i][j - 1], dp[i - 1][j]);\n        }\n    }\n\n    return dp[m - 1][n - 1];\n}","collabId":"7b3eae4a-2fd4-437c-85cc-f80d3b6ec8b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"6d6b0dfc-e02a-49c0-9755-c21c9c22a42a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"5a649ac0-0835-43b9-be61-856b8f85423c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"960eee95-3f4f-4646-974a-dd87d2d80fe9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4672bdaf-7837-4f25-b98f-7f5e4f7f309d","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/minimum-path-sum/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"9d418b0f-7eac-4769-a8c1-0fec83e72b96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最小路径和"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"动态规划"},{"label":"最小路径和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:712","type":"doc","id":712}}],"prevPage":{"title":"最大子序和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:711","type":"doc","id":711}},"nextPage":{"title":"买卖股票的最佳时机 II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:719","type":"doc","id":719}},"createTime":1729002519061,"updateTime":1744296694958,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296694958}}